1
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:16,524
Corvax! Stop the computer!

2
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,885
I can't, your Majesty.

3
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:22,804
Of course you can. It's your computer.

4
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,281
Yes, I know.

5
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,403
It's mine, but I can't stop it.

6
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,643
Well I can stop it.

7
00:00:30,839 --> 00:00:32,887
Excuse me. Excuse me.

8
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:39,002
Be careful! Be careful!

9
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,441
It's all right, Corvax.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,808
Don't... don't do that!

11
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:54,846
Corvax! Corvax!

12
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,650
Help me!

13
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:02,126
Look!

14
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,606
-There's one! -And there's one!

15
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,490
And there!

16
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:09,523
Oh, there are lots of them!

17
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,403
There's a fat one!

18
00:01:13,079 --> 00:01:15,809
Ah, that one's fatter! Look!

19
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,723
There's a big one!

20
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,929
That's a bigger one over there!

21
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,803
Come on, Muzzy!

22
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:31,129
I'm big.

23
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,889
I'm bigger.

24
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:36,288
The first one's big.

25
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:39,087
The second one's bigger.

26
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:41,043
I'm small.

27
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:43,639
Yes. The third one's small.

28
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:47,040
And the fourth one's smaller.

29
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:50,240
The fifth is tall.

30
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,401
The sixth is taller.

31
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:58,291
The seventh is... fat.

32
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:01,080
And the eighth is...

33
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:03,123
Fatter.

34
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,250
Fatter.

35
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:12,840
Help me, Corvax.

36
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:15,007
I can't, your Majesty.

37
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,289
Silly! You're silly!

38
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:20,885
Oh dear! What can I do ?

39
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:24,050
Ah, I can run away.

40
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,840
Yes! The helicopter!

41
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:32,167
Help! Help, Corvax! Corvax!

42
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,289
Excuse me, your Majesty.

43
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:38,402
What's happening? Where are you going?

44
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:41,169
To the helicopter.

45
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,771
Help!

46
00:02:44,439 --> 00:02:48,285
The King's in the computer, Corvax.

47
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:51,200
Stop! Come back!

48
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,370
Corvax!

49
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:56,167
Hey, stop!

50
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:02,404
Muzzy, go up there to the computer room!

51
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:05,761
Help the Queen. I can stop Corvax.

52
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,361
Sorry!

53
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,964
Excuse me!

54
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:13,084
Excuse me.

55
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,169
Oh, I beg your pardon.

56
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:18,649
Stop! Stop!

57
00:03:21,039 --> 00:03:22,164
Stop!

58
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:28,442
Who's... What's that?

59
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,804
It's all right. That's Muzzy.

60
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,846
He's a friend.

61
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:37,199
Muzzy, this is the Queen.

62
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,640
Your Majesty!

63
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:43,844
What's happening? What's that green thing?

64
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:48,449
Oh, that's not a thing. That's Muzzy.

65
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,445
He's a friend.

66
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:53,926
But he can't help! Where's Corvax?

67
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:58,001
Ah, yes. Corvax can help.

68
00:03:58,199 --> 00:04:00,200
Corvax is clever.

69
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:03,085
No, he isn't. He's silly.

70
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:05,760
I can help, your Majesty.

71
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:08,725
You? But you aren't clever.

72
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,330
I am.

73
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,410
Lovely!

74
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:16,567
What are you doing, Muzzy?

75
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:18,523
Wait a moment!

76
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:39,609
-What are you doing? -Excuse me.

77
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:41,768
I'm hungry.

78
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,449
Hungry?

79
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,769
But the King's in there.

80
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:48,359
Why are you eating that?

81
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,846
Because I like it.

82
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,480
Ah, I see.

83
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,206
This goes here.

84
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:02,806
This goes here.

85
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,569
No, no it doesn't.

86
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:07,648
Careful, please, Muzzy!

87
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:11,048
It's all right. It goes in here.

88
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:15,886
And this goes in here.

89
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:34,167
All right, your Majesty. I'm ready.

90
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,970
I'm ready too. It's hot in here.

91
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,604
That's better.

92
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:56,441
Thank you, Muzzy. You are clever.

93
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,084
Where's Bob?

94
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:05,964
Bob? Bob the gardener?

95
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:08,007
Oh, look...

96
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:17,245
Come on, Bob! Great!

97
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:19,567
-Well done, Bob! -Come on!

98
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,801
-Great. -Well done, Bob.

99
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,960
OK. We've got him.

100
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:46,725
Corvax! Corvax!

101
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,365
Wake up!

102
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:53,247
What's happening?

103
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:56,042
Who are you?

104
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,925
Where am I?

105
00:06:58,519 --> 00:07:00,009
Why am I here?

106
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,568
Who am I?

107
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:06,442
You are Corvax. And you are silly.

108
00:07:07,439 --> 00:07:10,362
Yes, I'm silly.

109
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:14,564
No, I'm not. I'm clever.

110
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:17,610
You are not clever, Corvax.

111
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:21,610
Take him away!

112
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:26,041
Yes, take him away!

113
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:51,126
Stand there! Now...

114
00:07:56,279 --> 00:07:58,168
try this.

115
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,131
They're going.

116
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:09,800
They're going into the computer.

117
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,682
There goes a red one.

118
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:16,483
There goes a blue.

119
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,608
There goes a green one.

120
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,723
A black and white one too.

121
00:08:21,199 --> 00:08:25,090
Lots and lots of Sylvias, coming back this way.

122
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,523
Three cheers for Muzzy.

123
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,961
Hurray! Hurray! Hurray!

124
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:32,480
Now there are ten of them.

125
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,487
Now there are nine.

126
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:36,840
Eight, seven, six, five,

127
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,722
coming on behind.

128
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:41,047
Four's going in now.

129
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,889
There goes number three.

130
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,646
Number two and number one.

131
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:48,969
-And that leaves... -Me!

132
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,001
Hurray! Hurray! Hurray!

133
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:56,927
You and I are happy.

134
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,805
<i>A, E, I, O, U.</i>

135
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:04,482
Now we are together.

136
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:07,204
I love you.

137
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,080
Who is that beautiful girl?

138
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,124
What is her name?

139
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,288
Where does she come from?

140
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,403
When can I see her?

141
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,489
Why am I down here?

142
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:44,881
Now we are together.

143
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:47,447
I love you.

144
00:09:54,679 --> 00:09:56,443
That goes in there.

145
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,884
This goes up here.

146
00:09:59,679 --> 00:10:02,409
I don't like this job.

147
00:10:03,679 --> 00:10:05,965
-That one. -This one?

148
00:10:06,279 --> 00:10:07,928
No, the big one.

149
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:11,362
Oh, dear! Oh dear! Oh dear!

150
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,920
Now for that one.

151
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,087
This?

152
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,646
And that one!

153
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:20,679
What a dirty job!

154
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:24,403
Now it's lunch-time.

155
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:26,568
Yes, I'm hungry.

156
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:29,409
-Take all those away. -Oh dear!

157
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,761
Oh dear! Oh dear!

158
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,488
Now I'm in my spaceship.

159
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:38,328
Now I'm going away.

160
00:10:39,039 --> 00:10:40,882
Thank you. Thank you, Muzzy.

161
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,844
Please come back some day.

162
00:10:43,039 --> 00:10:45,280
Goodbye! Goodbye! Goodbye!

163
00:10:49,639 --> 00:10:51,880
We're saying goodbye to Muzzy.

164
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,969
We're saying goodbye to you.

165
00:10:55,679 --> 00:10:58,364
The King, the Queen,

166
00:10:58,639 --> 00:11:00,447
